  deadMember: []
  gossip:
  - I discovered my left foot was much more bigger that my right foot. That's all.
  - 'Yesterday evening, my slipper was stuck under my bed. I am frustrated and have
    only one slipper. '
  - 'I ate a radish and now i love radishes. Maybe it became my favourite food. '
  - 'I just started to write a book about stones, so i gathered a lot of them. '
  - 'I can''t stand washing dishes, I am sure God will grant me a bright future instead. '
  - 'You are so beautiful. Is that love ? '
  - 'I like just laying on the floor watching the night sky. '
  - 'I think The Elephant lost some weight. Intriguing, isn''t it ? '
  - 'I found a clover without leaves, but The Sheep said it was grass. Such a liar. '
  - 'I saw The Bear pulled they tooth, i still have chills in my spin. '
  - 'I heard The Bird telling they were going to kill all believers in they dreams.
    Beware. '
  - 'The Pig stole my kouign amann. They sure are the demon. '
  - 'I saw The Pouloup burning some butter yesterday. They said it was spoiled but
    i think it''s a lie. '
  - 'I heard The Monkey doubting of our cult. '
  - 'The Koala spit in the kouign amann factory. Burn them ! '
  - 'Thr Rat put some butter without salt in their cake. They are definitely the
    demon ! '
  - 'The Cat threw my kouign amann by the window. '
  - 'I dislike butter-nut. It''s disgusting. '
  - 'The sandwich with fries is an absolute wonder. It seems to swallow my soul. '
  sacrificeSelection: {fileID: 0}
  defaultCameraLocation: {x: -9.75, y: 3.5, z: 0}
  defaultCameraRotation: {x: 0.07698051, y: 0.702904, z: -0.07698051, w: 0.702904}
